  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-02",
  "title": "Memory",
  "storyCode": "3-2",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a65717afa177f6bc4fb321def5019432ee3097ec6e4a6e18e583c4072e2bf47a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "So, you must be Misha?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Hello.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "I've heard a lot about you from Skullshatterer. Now, I finally get to meet you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Are you also... Infected...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Yes, I am.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Why did you... join Reunion?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "My wife, my child... they were all killed by the Chernobogians.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Under Ursus, the Infected were treated worse than lifestock.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "The destruction of Chernobog...? No, no. That is far too light of a punishment...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Do you know how much blood is on their hands?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Misha... We've been feared, exploited, humiliated, and persecuted...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...Just because of the fact that we're Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Not for any other reason.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "S-sorry, I got a bit heated. Forget what I said.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Ivan, come help tend to the injured.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Coming.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "We're only using this abandoned mine as a temporary base until we can reorganize and regroup.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Once the time is right, we'll make our way back to Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Al--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "No...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I threw away that name long ago.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Why...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "That person already died.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Just call me Skullshatterer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Are you... afraid?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Skull...shatterer? ...Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Ah... You'll soon understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "After we learned that you ended up as a refugee in Lungmen, everyone volunteered to go rescue you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "We've also accepted many new members there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "But... you're hurting people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't want to... do that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Why are the Infected fighting each other...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "An eye for an eye, as things should be.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "There is a saying in Ursus. 'Welcome your kin as you would welcome the warm spring...'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "'But welcome your enemies...'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "... ... ...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "What's wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...Do you know?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "No... No, you don't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "When they came for me, they dragged me out of my house...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "What's wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I saw my mother. She grabbed my hand...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You saw it too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...No...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You must have--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "They beat her mercilessly, but she wouldn't let go of me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "She left a trail of blood in the snow as they dragged her away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "If Reunion had... If the Infected could have... If only--!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "If they came sooner, none of this would have happened!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "We would not have had to suffer so much!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I... I wasn't brave enough to...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I... Aaaahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Misha...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "It'll be fine... It'll all be fine in the end.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I don't blame you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Back then... who would've been brave enough?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "But now, Reunion has given me that bravery.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Al--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Skullshatterer...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Whether or not you trust us is up to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Even if you trust us, whether or not you join us is also up to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "But you are an Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Reunion... will definitely fight until the bitter end so that the Infected can be free.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "But... you destroyed Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Along with countless innocents--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...Innocents?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Hah. Who's innocent?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "When Chernobog implemented the quarantine, did any of them speak out against it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "When Ursus sent us to die in the mines and the frozen wastelands, did any of them do anything about it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Did any of them ever stand up for us?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't know...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...Reunion has two leaders who fought for Ursus for a long time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "They said that there were some in Ursus who stood against the government for the sake of the Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "But they weren't in Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Chernobog coldly turned a blind eye towards us as we died...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "No, they laughed as they watched us die!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Chernobog... deserved to be destroyed!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I met other people who were helping the Infected... They...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Rhodes Island?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Despite being Infected, they helped Lungmen and harmed us, didn't they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "They slew our comrades and decimated our brethren, didn't they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "No...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "You couldn't see the truth. But it should be clear to you now...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "...Sorry, I let my anger take over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "It's fine... I...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I understand how you feel...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "You must have been suffering so much... all this time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Everyone has been through a lot.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "But right now, at least we have hope.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Talulah... She is the one who took charge of the Infected and led the fight against the cruelty of this world.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Reunion is the only hope we have.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I see... You've all suffered so much...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "If Reunion can really protect them all...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "Just like how Reunion will protect everyone... I will protect you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "text": "I won't let anyone hurt you anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Skullshatterer...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Ooh, I found 'em--!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Looks like they sustained some pretty serious losses.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Luckily, I didn't head back to the company headquarters... Otherwise, I would've needed to make a long detour for this mission...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Try to predict their escape routes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Send all likely routes along with their bearings to Amiya.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "I'll be done in a sec!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Hmph.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "We can't give Reunion time to regroup.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Hmmm, let's see... over here... like this... and that should do it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Are you done, Exusiai?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "What do you need? How are we going to do this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Let's have a little warm-up first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Start with their sentries.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
